There's nothing else I need.

272
00:23:28,900 --> 00:23:32,100
I can't see the smile.

273
00:23:32,900 --> 00:23:45,937
I can't see it.

274
00:23:46,020 --> 00:23:48,240
Never lose.

275
00:23:50,300 --> 00:23:52,980
Na, na, na, na.

276
00:23:54,020 --> 00:23:58,637
Na, na, na, na, na.

277
00:23:58,720 --> 00:24:05,117
Na, na, na, na.

278
00:24:05,200 --> 00:24:10,057
Self-protection, the means
of protecting oneself.

279
00:24:10,140 --> 00:24:13,417
People expose the
weaknesses which pain them.

280
00:24:13,500 --> 00:24:14,940
and thus form a group.

281
00:24:15,620 --> 00:24:19,157
Before they know it, they begin to
exclude those who are not one of them.

282
00:24:19,240 --> 00:24:22,122
But what becomes of those
who have been excluded?

283
00:24:22,540 --> 00:24:27,011
I smiled at the children who lived in
a tight group, in their rickety house.

284
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:32,600
Sure, let's live today, let's live
tomorrow, and let's live the day after that,

285
00:24:33,060 --> 00:24:35,413
even if it means living in eternal pain.
